+# AUDIT: AdvancedProfileCreator + Dimension Tools Panel
+
+> **Date:** 2026-09-17
+> **Baseline:** 1277 tests, ALL OK | Smoke PASS
+> **Purpose:** Full architecture + code + API + plan for both features
+
+---
+
+## TABLE OF CONTENTS
+
+1. [Executive Summary](#1-executive-summary)
+2. [Feature 1: AdvancedProfileCreator](#2-feature-1-advancedprofilecreator)
+3. [Feature 2: Dimension Tools Panel](#3-feature-2-dimension-tools-panel)
+4. [Shared Infrastructure](#4-shared-infrastructure)
+5. [Implementation Plan](#5-implementation-plan)
+6. [Risk Matrix](#6-risk-matrix)
