+| PartCreatorMixin | `ui/mixins/part_creator.py` | COMPLETE | 3 creation paths + table editing |
+| CreatePartDialog | `ui/dialogs/create_part/dialog.py` | COMPLETE | Splitter: tabs + canvas + cotation |
