+### 2.5 Current CreatePartDialog vs AdvancedProfileCreator
+
+| Aspect | CreatePartDialog (current) | AdvancedProfileCreator (target) |
+|--------|---------------------------|--------------------------------|
+| Window type | QDialog (modal) | QMainWindow (floating) |
+| Layout | Simple splitter | CAD-style 3-panel + ribbon |
+| Profile catalog | Popup dialog | Inline combo/panel |
+| Canvas | Static preview | Interactive zoom/pan/measure |
+| Holes/slots | Basic table | Interactive click-to-add from canvas |
