+
+### 2.6 Approach Options
+
+**Option A: Extend CreatePartDialog (Minimal)**
+- Add ribbon toolbar to existing dialog
+- Wire snap engine + dimension tools
+- Keep QDialog modality
+- Risk: QDialog size constraints, no floating
+
+**Option B: New QMainWindow (Full rebuild)**
+- New `AdvancedProfileCreator(QMainWindow)` in `ui/dialogs/advanced_profile_creator/`
+- Reuse all existing engines (Contour, DXF, Snap, Dimension, Catalog)
+- Replace CreatePartDialog as the primary creation path
+- Risk: Large new file, but engines are all proven
+
+**Option C: Scaffold + wire incrementally**
+- Create skeleton QMainWindow with splitter
+- Wire ONE engine at a time (Catalog first, then Contour, then Snap, then Dimension)
+- Each wiring = 1 test cycle
+- Risk: Smallest per-step risk, but takes more sessions
+
+**Recommended: Option C** — incremental wiring with test verification at each step.
