+## 6. RISK MATRIX
+
+| Risk | Impact | Likelihood | Mitigation |
+|------|--------|------------|------------|
+| Break existing CreatePartDialog | HIGH | LOW | Don't modify it — AdvancedProfileCreator is a NEW widget |
+| Break 2D viewer painting | HIGH | LOW | `_draw_shapes` changes already verified (1277 OK) |
