+# NC MANAGER V1.21 — FULL PROJECT AUDIT
+
+> **Audit date:** 2026-09-01
+> **Auditor:** Guardian (OpenCode) — read/analyze/document only, NO code changes, NO fixes, NO refactors.
+> **Audit method:** on-disk evidence (source, tests, configs, docs, git history); desktop app not run live.
