+---
+
+## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
+
+**NC MANAGER V1.21** is a proprietary, closed-source desktop application for managing steel-fabrication machining files (CNC programs). It loads `*.nc` / `*.nc1` (DSTV NC1 format) machining programs, **automatically classifies** each part by category / section / operation, **displays** it in 2D and 3D with true hole/slot geometry, allows **direct correction** (hole diameters, X/Y positions, lengths, angles, planes), **measures** between points, **exports** to multiple formats, and manages **projects** (persisted imported copies + manifests).
+
+The package name is still **`nccorrection`** (kept deliberately — see §5). The UI/commercial display name is **NC MANAGER V1.21**.
+
+- **Written in:** Python 3.12+ (per requirement lock; environment targets noted up to 3.14), PySide6/Qt6 GUI.
+- **Scope:** single-user desktop tool for the owner's steel workshop/prefabrication workflow (order-based file management, hole/slot editing, blueprint-style drawings).
+- **Language of UI:** English / French (i18n via `translations.py`).
+- **No database:** persistence is JSON-file based (`settings/`, `projects/<name>/project.json`).
+- **License:** proprietary, all rights reserved (see §21).
+
+---
+
+## 2. FEATURE OVERVIEW
+
+### 2.1 Analysis & Import
+- Load `*.nc` / `*.nc1` (NC1/DSTV) files; also `*.dxf` (2D line drawings via ezdxf engine) and planned `*.dwg` (blocked on converter availability, see §14).
+- Format sniffing via `engine/format_analyzer.py` — content-first detection (NC1 ↔ DXF ↔ UNKNOWN), not extension guessing.
+- Automatic classification: category / section (profile family) / operation / presence of holes-slots / O plane / SI-EN block.
+- Import copies files into a project DB (`projects/<name>/`), never touches originals.
+
+### 2.2 Visualization
+- **2D viewer** (`NcViewer`): grid, axes, dimensioning, unfolded-by-faces layout, blueprint view, hover hole labels, measure tool, snap.
+- **3D viewer** (`NcViewer3D`): arcball rotate, pan, cursor-anchored zoom, orbit inertia/fling, Ctrl+R pivot-pick mode, hover X/Y readout, spin auto-rotation, view presets, real-world axis triad.
+- **Blueprint / Unfolded view** (`DstvRenderer2D`): Tekla-style fabrication blueprint, face layout, hole grouping with `NxØD` labels, miter-cut angle callouts.
+- **Steel Engine view**: profile catalog browser (IPE range).
+
+### 2.3 Editing (Holes & Slots)
+- Full hole/slot edit from **2D, 3D, and blueprint** via right-click context menu (Edit / Change plane / Copy / Paste / Delete)).
+- Manual input with live preview; hole copy/paste across parts (Ctrl+C/Ctrl+V, same faces or choose other faces).
+- True slot B-Rep; dead-on osnap; blueprint is WYSIWYG (renders edited text).
+- Undo/redo; dirty-state tracking with restore-original.
+
+### 2.4 Sorting & Orders
+- Sort-into-folders (organizer) with original-name preservation (never hash names in output).
+- Order management (P-stream): rename order, delete order, new order, move/copy files between orders, internal file clipboard (Ctrl+C/X/V row-based).
+- Order name is applied INSIDE the NC1 header when the user chooses.
+
+### 2.5 Export
+- Export to: NC/NC1, CN, DXF (per-face, real or blueprint layout), OBJ, STL, PDF (via `ui/pdf_export.py`).
+- DXF export with face layers (FACE_V/O/U/H) and blueprint layout option.
+
+### 2.6 Project Management
+- Save/load/open projects; each project = folder with imported copies + `project.json` manifest (files, settings, notes, hole overrides, deleted/added holes, quantities, orders, sort history).
+- Startup auto-load of `last_project`; audit log; per-file notes.
+
+### 2.7 Measurement & Drafting
+- Measure toolbar; measure distance with frameless midpoint labels; draggable dimension lines (parallel move).
+- OSNAP (snap-to-hole/contour) with right-click menu.
+- Drafting settings dialog (two tabs, two-way bound to `DesignSettings`).
