+
+### Key architectural facts
+- **`ui/app.py` → `NCManagerApp`** is the central application object (very large, ~265 KB). Persistence/import logic lives in `services/`. UI calls services; keep that direction.
+- **Canonical geometry contract:** `core/viewer.parse_geometry(text)` → dict; hole edits → `core/hole_ops.apply_edits(geometry, overrides, deleted, added)`. DXF reader emits the same dict. **Do not fork viewers per format.**
+- **Decoupling law (blueprint):** `DstvRenderer2D` imports `get_profile` from `engine/steel_engine/catalog` (engine-pure); it does NOT import `ui.app`. Poids U uses catalog facts, not the app's private `_part_metrics`.
+- **Close confirmation:** `_confirm_close` opens only when there are unsaved edits OR files added in the current session (`_session_added`). A truly idle session closes silently (ProNest-style). A session that imported but did nothing else still prompts.
