+| 9 | **Mémotech rule engine (safety)** — edge distance e≥1.2d, pitch rules, standardized error codes, no UI deps | `core/safety_engine.py` (314 l) — *see §4: unreachable from UI* |
+| 10 | **Import pipeline** — NC1/CN files, folders, DXF (ezdxf, 2D-only), DWG via external ODA converter with clear non-blocking message; order detection/conflict resolution (Replace/Ignore/Compare) | `core/importer.py`, `core/order_utils.py`, `engine/dxf/dxf_parser.py`, services |
+| 11 | **Orders & projects** — order rename/move/copy, project save/load, source-folder, persistence via services layer | `services/project_service.py` (373 l), app.py order/project flows |
+| 12 | **Organizer** — plan/execute move-copy with conflict preview + delete-original option | `core/organizer.py` (189 l), app.py organize popup (5352+) |
+| 13 | **Hole editing suite** — editable table (delegates), add/delete/clone/copy/paste, dynamic per-part faces, undo/redo all (HistoryButton), SI/EN insertion | app.py delegates + hole flows, `core/hole_ops.py`, `core/plane_switcher.py`, `core/nc1_writer.py` |
+| 14 | **Export** — NC/NC1/CN (edited text), per-face DXF (blueprint/real), PDF (widget render), Save-Original/Save-Copy semantics | `core/dxf_writer.py`, `ui/pdf_export.py`, `_export_one` |
+| 15 | **Production UI** — bootloader splash, monochrome+steel-blue theme, sidebar navigation, EN/FR translations (405 keys × 2), toolbars, shortcuts | `main.py`, `ui/components/splash.py`, `ui/styles.py`, `ui/translations.py` |
+| 16 | **Test foundation** — 31 test modules ≈ 11 500 lines; full green suite (see baseline); headless E2E harness 52 real ops | `tests/`, `tools/e2e_walkthrough.py` |
+
+**Honest verdict on §1:** the foundation is real and unusually broad for a solo project — parser, viewers, metrology, catalog, safety rules, exports, projects, and a serious test suite. The problems are not "nothing works"; they are structure, reachability, and error-swallowing (below).
