+### 2.4 Smell near the graveyard (not dead, but symptomatic)
+- `apply_hole_edits` is inline-imported **5 times** inside app.py methods (`2660`, `3697`, `4162`, `5173`, `6085`) instead of once at module top — an "append new feature" pattern that has been repeated.
