+## 7. Main Workspace Specification
+
+**Requirement (owner):**
+- The **table and viewer** must have a **smooth horizontal splitter**.
+- The user must be able to **freely resize** the file table and the viewer.
+- Full control of available screen space, without awkward resizing behavior.
+
+**What this means (definition, not implementation):**
+- A single draggable boundary between the files table and the viewer.
+- Resize must be smooth (no jitter), predictable, and allow the user to grant most of the screen to whichever side they are working on.
+- Extremes (near-full table, near-full viewer) must be reachable and stable.
+
+**`OPEN DECISION`:** Minimum / maximum splitter fractions, and default proportion. Not specified by the owner.
+
