+## 8. Project Management UX
+
+**Requirement (owner):**
+- Project selector shows a project name (e.g. `STE ACTION IMMC`).
+- There is a pencil to rename the project.
+- **Rename behavior is important:** renaming the project **also changes the project folder/name** used by the application's storage system.
+- The **pencil must remain close to the project selector**.
+- There must also be a **right-click context action on the project name** to rename the project.
+- **Do not remove or break existing project logic.**
