+**Verification notes (source):**
+- Current implementation has an order rename pencil (`order_rename_btn`, `_rename_order`) and project naming via `_ask_import_project_name`. There is an existing project/order concept; the pencil currently targets the **order**.
+- The owner's requirement asks for a **project** rename that propagates to the **storage folder/name**. This is a behavior beyond the current order-rename and must be reconciled carefully so that the project storage logic is not broken (§26).
+
+**Definition:**
+- Project selector + pencil (adjacent).
+- Right-click on project name → context action "Rename project".
+- Renaming updates: (a) the visible project name, and (b) the project's storage folder/name used by the persistence layer — as one coherent, safe operation.
