+## 15. Snap / Cursor UX
+
+**Requirement (owner):**
+- Cursor snapping must feel: **precise, smooth, predictable, professional**.
+- **Do not change the snapping engine during this phase.**
+- **Only document the UX requirement.**
+
+**Definition (UX acceptance criteria for later):**
+- Snapping to meaningful geometry (endpoints, midpoints, hole centers, intersections) is exact and stable (no jumping past the target).
+- The cursor gives clear visual feedback of the snapped target.
+- Snapping feels immediate and predictable, not laggy or overshooting.
+
+**`OPEN DECISION`:** Which snap points matter most and whether snapping is toggleable/coarse-grained. Not specified.
