+## 25. Professional Product Rules
+
+- **Never feel like** a demo, prototype, mockup, an unfinished AI-generated app, a collection of unrelated dialogs, or a generic template.
+- **Professional does not mean** more buttons / animations / decoration / complexity.
+- **Professional means** clear, predictable, coherent, efficient, precise, industrial, trustworthy, consistent, easy to understand, safe for real work.
+- Every UI decision follows **human/workflow logic**.
+- No invented product requirements — mark `OPEN DECISION` instead.
+- No emulation of other products as a spec unless the owner says so.
+- UI redesign sits **on top of** existing working functionality wherever possible — not a rewrite.
+
