+  What was added:
+    - `_bend_boundary(bend)` — (coord_index, value) of the split plane; dominant-axis
+      rule IDENTICAL to `bend_side` (x=x1 for vertical-ish, y=y1 for horizontal-ish).
+    - `_clip_halfplane(pts, idx, c, keep_greater)` — Sutherland-Hodgman clip to one side
