+B) `_build_viewer_menu` signature gains `local_pos` and the action is inserted right after the Undo/Redo separator (before Measure), keeping EVERY original action:
+
+```python
+    def _build_viewer_menu(self, view, local_pos=None):
+        menu = QMenu(self)
+        menu.setStyleSheet(_VIEWER_MENU_QSS)
+        ...
+        act = menu.addAction(self.tr_('redo'))
+        act.setShortcut('Ctrl+Y')
