+Enforce a consistent, modern dark theme across all PySide6/Qt components.
+## Strict Rules
+1. **Palette:**
+   - Background: `#0f172a` (App background).
+   - Surface/Panels: `#1e293b` (Widgets, Tables, Dialogs).
+   - Borders/Gridlines: `#334155`.
+   - Accent Primary: `#007acc` (Active buttons, highlights).
+   - Text: `#f8fafc` (Primary text), `#94a3b8` (Muted/Headers).
+2. **Typography:** `Segoe UI` or `Inter` (sans-serif), bold for headers.
+3. **Anti-Patterns (DO NOT USE):**
+   - NO white backgrounds. NO default OS gray buttons.
+   - NO verbose text strings. 
