+# NC Manager V1.21 — Current Core Idea / UI Contract 2026-07-30
+
+## Purpose
+This is the current source of truth for the NC Manager V1.21 product idea and operation area. It supersedes older `Operations Stage`, Arabic tab labels, and organize-popup instructions.
+
+---
+
+## Core product idea
+
+NC Manager V1.21 is a desktop application for working with `.nc` and `.nc1` files.
+
+Main flow:
+
+```text
+CN/NC1 button
+-> File table
+-> Organize tab under file table
+-> Preview/Apply safe organize plan
+```
+
+---
+
+## Main intake
+
+Button:
+
+```text
+CN/NC1
+```
+
+Icon:
+
+```text
+folder-cyan-open.png
+```
+
+Rules:
+- Load `.nc` and `.nc1` files.
+- Prevent loading the same file twice.
+- Read content first for classification and header data.
+- Do not move/copy/delete files during intake.
+
+---
+
+## File table
+
+Default visible columns:
+
+```text
+File Name
+Path
+Type
+Family
+Status
+```
+
+Rules:
+- Do not show all columns by default.
+- Columns must auto-fit the available table width.
+- Columns must still be manually resizable.
+- Remove nested/double table scrollbars.
+
+---
+
+## Tool Dock under File Table
+
+Current tabs:
+
+```text
+Organize
+Rename
+O-Plane
+SI / EN
+Holes
+Audit / History
+```
+
+No Arabic UI labels.  
+No old Operations Stage modal.  
+No separate organize popup.
+
+---
+
+## Tab: Organize
+
+Fields:
+
+```text
+Output folder name
+Use custom output folder
+Delete old scattered files
+```
+
+Actions:
+
+```text
+Apply
+Preview plan
+```
+
+Rules:
+- Apply prepares a safe organization plan.
+- If no files loaded, block with warning.
+- If conflicts exist, block with error.
+- Deleting old scattered files is a plan option only; real deletion requires successful organize, dry-run, backup and confirmation.
+
+---
+
+## Tab: Rename
+
+Fields:
+
+```text
+Scope: Chosen file / All loaded files
+Prefix
+Suffix
+Delete text from filename
+Auto numbering
+```
+
+Actions:
+
+```text
+Apply
+Preview
+```
+
+Rules:
+- Rename is draft/safe first.
+- User must be able to apply to chosen file or all loaded files.
+- Collision protection is required in desktop implementation.
+
+---
+
+## Tab: O-Plane
+
+Fields:
+
+```text
+From plane: o/u/h
+To plane: o/u/h
+```
+
+Actions:
+
+```text
+Detect plane
+Convert plane draft
+```
+
+Rules:
+- Plane conversion must be configurable.
+- Do not hardcode only `o -> u`.
+- Only transform face letters in allowed geometry/marking blocks:
+  - BO
+  - AK
+  - IK
+  - SI
+  - PU
+  - KO
+- No random text replacement.
+- Draft first; backup/confirmation before write.
+
+---
+
+## Tab: SI / EN
+
+Displays:
+
+```text
+SI/EN detected count
+```
+
+Actions:
+
+```text
+Detect SI/EN
+Clear SI/EN draft
+Add SI/EN draft
+```
+
+Rules:
+- Original NC1 not modified directly.
+- Draft first.
+
+---
+
+## Tab: Holes
+
+Displays:
+
+```text
+Round holes detected
+Long holes / slots detected
+```
+
+Actions:
+
+```text
+- 1 mm / + 1 mm for round hole diameter
+- 1 mm / + 1 mm for long slot width
+```
+
+Rules:
+- This adjusts existing hole/slot dimensions only.
+- It must not add new holes.
+- It must not remove holes.
+- Parser validation is required before execute.
+
+---
+
+## Tab: Audit / History
+
+Contains:
+
+```text
+Audit / History
+Actions dropdown
+Delete history
+Disable/Enable audit
+Export report
+audit lines
+```
+
+Rules:
+- Audit starts empty.
+- No fake startup OK entries.
+- Entries appear only after real user actions.
+
+---
+
+## Quantity parsing
+
+Quantity must be read from the ST header.
+
+Practical rule:
+
+```text
+Find material grade line such as S235JR.
+If the next non-empty ST line is an integer, that line is quantity.
+```
+
+Fallback only after that:
+
+```text
+QTY / QUANTITY / NBR / NB
+```
+
+If still missing, use `1` and add warning.
+
+---
+
+## Language rule
+
+Active UI must contain no Arabic labels.
+
+Target UI languages:
+
+```text
+English
+French
+```
+
+Default active preview can show English. Desktop implementation must provide English/French translation support.
+
+---
+
+## Forbidden unless user asks again
+
+```text
+Browse button
+Directory label
+Text Add Files button
+Arabic UI labels
+Old Operations Stage modal
+Separate organize popup
+Classification panel hide toggle
+Theme Builder wording
+Help / About wording
+Fake startup audit success
+All table columns visible by default
+```
