+Pure parsing/data-model (no GUI) plus two Qt widgets:
+  * renderer_2d.DstvRenderer2D — face-by-face 2D development view
+  * renderer_3d.DstvRenderer3D — thin adapter over the shared 3D core
+    (NcViewer3D): arcball orbit, target-based TRT pivot, raycaster, measure
+    tool and CAD OSNAP glyphs all live in that one core, not duplicated here.
+
+The engine is independent of the rest of NC Manager on purpose: it only
+consumes the raw NC1 text and produces its own data model (DstvPart), so the
+face coordinate systems stay correct per face (Bug 1: separate viewports).
+"""
