+        """P1 error funnel (S18 map): every formerly-silent handler routes the
+        exception here. The message is recorded in the audit service with the
+        ERR-P1 code (error entries persist even when auditing is disabled) and
+        optionally surfaced to the user. Callers ALWAYS keep their fallback
+        value so the application state does not crash."""
