+"""Toolbar widgets for the NC Manager main window.
+
+Each toolbar encapsulates its own buttons, context menus and signals so the
+main app file only wires high-level behaviour instead of building low-level
+controls. ``measure_toolbar`` owns the Measure button, its right-click OSNAP
+menu and the Drafting Settings placeholder.
+"""
